| !SSHd - SSH server for RISC OS
| Runs the server in a TaskWindow so the desktop keeps multitasking.
Set SSHd$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <SSHd$Dir>.!Sprites
RMEnsure CryptRandom 0.00 Error SSHd needs the CryptRandom module (RISC OS 5.2x or later)
RMEnsure TaskWindow 0.00 Error SSHd needs the TaskWindow module
RMEnsure Internet 5.00 Error SSHd needs the Internet module (networking is not configured)
If "<Choices$Write>" = "" Then Error SSHd needs the Choices system (boot from !Boot)
IfThere <Choices$Write>.SSHd Then Else CDir <Choices$Write>.SSHd
| UnixLib: no filename suffix swapping, keep our RISC OS paths as they are
Set UnixEnv$sshd$sfix ""
TaskWindow "<SSHd$Dir>.sshd -d <Choices$Write>.SSHd %*0" -name "SSH server" -wimpslot 2048K -quit -ctrl
